{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-1","title":"Ezekiel 18:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God defends his justice; 31 and exhorts to repentance.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-2","title":"Ezekiel 18:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>mean. 17:12; Isa 3:15; Ro 9:20 the land. 6:2,3; 7:2; 25:3; 36:1-6; 37:11,19,25 The fathers. Jer 15:4; 31:29,30; La 5:7; Mt 23:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-3","title":"Ezekiel 18:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>19,20,30; 33:11-20; 36:31,32; Ro 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-4","title":"Ezekiel 18:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>all souls. Nu 16:22; 27:16; Zec 12:1; Heb 12:9 the soul that. 20; Ro 6:23; Ga 3:10-13,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-5","title":"Ezekiel 18:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>if. Ps 15:2-5; 24:4-6; Mt 7:21-27; Ro 2:7-10; Jas 1:22-25; 2:14-26 1Jo 2:3,29; 3:7; 5:2-5; Re 22:14 that, etc. Heb. judgment and justice. 33:14; Ge 18:19; Pr 21:3; Jer 22:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-6","title":"Ezekiel 18:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>not. 11,15; 6:13; 20:28; 22:9; Ex 34:15; Nu 25:2; 1Co 10:20 neither hath lifted. 12,15; 20:7,24; 33:25,26; De 4:19; Ps 121:1; 123:1,2 neither hath defiled. 22:10,11; Le 18:19,20; 20:10,18; De 22:22-30; Jer 5:8,9; Mt 5:28 1Co 6:9-11; Ga 5:19-21; Heb 13:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-7","title":"Ezekiel 18:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStar