ook":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>that. 7; Mt 7:21-27; Lu 11:28; Joh 13:17; 15:14; Php 4:9; Jas 2:17 1Jo 3:22; Re 22:14 eaten. 6,15; 1Ki 13:8,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-12","title":"Ezekiel 18:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>oppressed. 7,16; Ho 12:7; Am 4:1; Zec 7:10; Jas 2:6 hath committed. 6; 8:6,17; Le 18:22,26-30; 2Ki 21:11; 23:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-13","title":"Ezekiel 18:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>given. 8,17 shall he. 24,28,32 blood. Heb. bloods. 3:18; 33:4; Le 20:9,11-13,27; Ac 18:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-14","title":"Ezekiel 18:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>if he. 10; Pr 17:21; 23:24 that seeth. 20:18; 2Ch 29:3-11; 34:21; Jer 9:14; 44:17; Mt 23:32; 1Pe 1:18 considereth. 28; Ps 119:59,60; Isa 44:19; Jer 8:6; Ho 7:2; Hag 1:5,7; 2:18 Lu 15:17-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-15","title":"Ezekiel 18:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>6,7,11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-16","title":"Ezekiel 18:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>withholden the pledge. Heb. pledged the pledge, or taken topledge. 7 but hath. Job 22:7; 31:19; Pr 22:9; 25:21; 31:20; Ec 11:1,2; Isa 58:7-10 Lu 11:41; 14:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-18-17","title":"Ezekiel 18:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>hath taken. 8; Job 29:16; Pr 14:31; 29:7,14; Jer 22:16; Da 4:27; Mt 18:27-35 Lu 19:8 that hath not. 8